WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.234
Welcome to Building Defender XDR,

2
00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:06.212
a developer workbook in the
Federal Modernization Workbook.

3
00:00:06.212 --> 00:00:10.151
This is Chapter 9: deploying
to test and production.

4
00:00:10.151 --> 00:00:14.343
The same commands run in both stages;
only the settings file changes,

5
00:00:14.343 --> 00:00:18.312
and production waits until the
test stage's own evidence says go.

6
00:00:18.312 --> 00:00:22.974
This chapter is a runbook, not a
gate, so it has no labs of its own.

7
00:00:22.974 --> 00:00:26.622
Every step is a command,
and the outputs on these

8
00:00:26.622 --> 00:00:30.363
slides are from fixture
mode on November 17, 2026.

9
00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:33.013
Nothing in it has been
run against a live tenant,

10
00:00:33.013 --> 00:00:35.710
and the chapter has been
reviewed and approved.
